**flow
dat file
↓→dat2root
↓
root file
↓→rootfile_reader
↓→rootfile_analyzer, waveform, waveform_map
↓→feature_extractor
feature file
↓→feature_reader
↓→feature_analyzer, feature_summary
↓→hit_extractor
hit file
↓→hit_reader
↓→hit_analyzer, hit_summary
↓→matched_hit_analyzer
↓→correlation_analyzer correlation_summary




**support
channel_map: channel map & digitizer ch → sensor ch
